WEBVTT

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.500
D–Did you see that?

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.820
It's him!

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.330
That's the fabled...

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:09.040
Devil Z!

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:24.480
<i>Devil Z</i>

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.150
<i>Several months earlier</i>

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.620
You've gotta be kidding!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.030
It's true! We're university students.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.480
Right, Akio?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.340
What was it, again?

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.240
Don't blow our cover, idiot.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.660
Let's just give up on them and go home.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.730
So, what university are you guys at?

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.470
Oh, uh... Tokyo U, yeah.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.750
Hey...

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.700
Akio, what the hell was that?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.760
It's the BlackBird!

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:31.500
Y–You mean <i>that</i> BlackBird?

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.950
Let's go, Maa!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.230
W–What?!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.200
Woo-hoo! Go get him!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.800
Go, go!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.390
C'mon, don't do this.
You don't have a chance against him.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.470
No, I can do it.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.260
I can keep up with him!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.270
<i>All right...</i>

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.780
I can do this!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:46.170
Your Z is a good car, ain't it?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.140
Yeah.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:48.770
But...

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:52.640
Hey, you were up against the BlackBird, right?

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.030
No point in going against him.
He's in a league of his own.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.020
The black leader of Wangan, the Porsche Turbo.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:05.820
He's been unbeatable for years now.
They call him the Emperor of Wangan.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.310
"Emperor" my ass!

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:12.530
Akio, you shouldn't talk with my brother too much.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.910
He's just a car maniac.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.450
Maniac or not, what do you care?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:23.540
Just quit this business and buy a
big apartment or something, man.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.880
Well, sorry about that.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.020
Oh, yeah...

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.010
Akio!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:29.810
What?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.690
There's a wrecked Z at Kuro's place.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.940
You wanted an original model Z, right?

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.700
Original model, huh?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:43.010
It's got good parts in it. Pop by and
check it out when you have the time.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.590
Ok, thanks!

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.720
Well, let's go right now, Kou-chan.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.750
Huh?! What about school, Akio?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.710
C'mon, it's fine. Let's go!

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.350
Hey, hey!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.000
Oh, well...

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.180
No, wait! I'm coming along!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>Kurosa Junkyard</i>

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.030
Looks like we're skipping school again today.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.670
We'll make it in time for second period, Maa.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.990
Let's see here...

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.300
Where is it?

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.230
Let's just forget this place and
pick up some chicks instead.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.570
The girls from yesterday ran away too. Something fun...

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.650
What are you looking at?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.650
I'm looking at that Z.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.790
Huh?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.730
Z?

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.280
That thing?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.270
Yeah.

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:17.810
The very first model of the Z, the S30.

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:18.930
Ooh...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.630
It's a Twin Turbo.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:30.210
When it comes to L28 engines, this one's fully set.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.480
The suspension's amazing too!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.590
Disc brakes.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.850
Sway bars.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.510
The whole thing's right on the money.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.100
Gimme a break, man.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.270
That's just sick.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:48.380
Yo, Kou-chan! Here's the registration
paper and license plate for that car.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.490
Oh, thanks, Kuro!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:51.920
This is it.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.260
Three numbers?

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:54.180
Yup.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.230
Why?

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:57.140
I mean, this Z...

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.910
I see.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.450
It's been tuned.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.280
Look here.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:05.050
It has "Modified" on the registration paper.

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:08.960
That L28 has been tuned with a turbo and all the works.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.930
Then, you don't have to punch tickets.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.070
Cool.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.730
Hey, Akio!

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.350
Check this out.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.550
The previous owner had your exact name!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.600
You're right. Man, that's creepy.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.650
It's as if it was saying "buy me."

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.110
Kuro, how much for that Z?

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.850
Well, about that...

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:37.070
C'mon, spit it out. Or do you have a buyer already?

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:42.590
That's not it, but I was told to totally scrap it.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:44.090
What?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:54.020
I read in the registration paper
that he was the third owner.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:59.540
It was out of the ordinary.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.850
He said, "Make sure you scrap that car."

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:06.390
He was all pale, and his lips were trembling.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:08.980
So, you're saying

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.470
it's a dangerous car?

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:15.570
There are some cars that are just bad luck.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.860
No. He said it was a ghost.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.570
A ghost?

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:22.200
This thing?

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:26.020
Yup, it seems it's an unusual car.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:29.330
Usually, after an accident, a car is no good.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.840
The engine gets busted or something like that.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.130
But this car is different.

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:38.720
No matter how many times you crash, this car
will be back on the road again like it's brand new,

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.130
as if it's yearning for blood.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.750
It's ok. I'm cool with that.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:43.750
Akio!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.850
I don't mind that. Please sell that Z to me.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.880
What the hell, man? Don't buy that creepy car!

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:52.650
Yeah, just let it be.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:54.900
Hey, Akio...

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:26.270
Kuro was worried.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.990
So that's how it is, huh?

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:30.840
You really love this car, or what?

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:33.320
I don't know how to put this...

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.520
It's not the best car, but...

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.350
This brings back memories.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.000
Memories?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.370
Three years ago...

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.280
This one time, on Yamashita Street,

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:50.050
someone was suddenly driving an
S30Z right before my eyes,

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.760
and there was a girl with short hair
in the front passenger seat.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.050
Looked really cool.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.470
Which one?

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:02.720
The girl?

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.920
Or the Z?

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.630
Oh, uh, both.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:08.720
So it's about admiration, then.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:11.770
Since then, I've wanted to get one no matter what;

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.430
the same kind of S30Z.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:19.480
Do you think it'll be difficult to repair, Kou-chan?

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:22.900
You really wanna drive it that badly?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.930
Yeah.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:27.810
Sounds like a pretty dangerous car,
from what Kuro said.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.450
You might be giving up your life for that.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.750
I don't think so.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.480
Well, let's give it a shot.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.730
Really? If you can, please.

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:13.050
I never thought you'd be this stupid.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.700
Too bad, Maa.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.360
Look, it's a two-seater.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:19.810
No more picking up girls.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:20.870
Yeah.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:25.320
Your old Z was better, but you just had to sell it.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.380
Akio! I've got the new registration paper.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.790
The official there was generous,
so the number stayed the same.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.880
It's your car now.

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.490
<i>So, have you gotten the hang of the car yet?</i>

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.330
<i>It's amazing, Kou-chan.</i>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.880
<i>The power is something else.</i>

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:06.590
<i>No matter how much you drive, you just want more.</i>

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.820
<i>Taking a liking to the car is fine,</i>

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.550
<i>but with this thing's history...</i>

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.620
<i>Take it easy.</i>

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.930
Don't overdo it, Akio.<b></b>

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.600
<i>All this time,</i>

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.540
<i>this car's been waiting for me.</i>

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.870
Asakura...

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:47.380
You probably know this already,
but you're not graduating.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.380
Your attendance has been terrible.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:53.910
What's it going to be? Will you be ok
with just repeating the class?

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:54.680
Yes.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.040
It's surprising that he's going to repeat the class.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:11.520
Yes, he's got good grades.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:14.950
Doesn't matter if he doesn't show up to school.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.800
If he's not in school, then what on earth is he doing?

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.240
Is he up to something bad?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:24.960
I heard a close friend of his
talking about a part-time job.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.510
A part-time job?

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.820
Right.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.020
Shimada-sensei!

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:29.770
Yes?

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:34.420
He'll be in your class in the new term.
Look after him.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.270
He's a good kid.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:39.780
Understood. I'll do my best.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.430
Everybody's fussing about the whole thing.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:48.020
All the girls in class are crying!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.830
Gotta give it up to you for not quitting.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.620
I thought you'd just drop out midterm
if you had to repeat a class.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.050
I figured it'd be ok.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:59.700
Well, starting next spring, I'll be a university student.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.670
Maybe I'll hook you up some nice ladies.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.730
I don't care about women that much.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.720
Ah, you bastard.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:10.750
You'll be popular with the girls without my help.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.710
That's not it.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:15.710
There's something more inspiring than women.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:18.030
Akio, you...

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.400
Well, then...

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.280
Now that I've ended up repeating a class,
I might as well go home.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.990
See you, Maa.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.390
Is it about that Z?

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.470
You should really sell that thing.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:39.320
You've been acting weird ever since you bought that
car. I mean, isn't that why you have to repeat that class?

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.570
Giving up job after job...

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:45.840
Someday, that car is going to end up killing you!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.080
It'll be fine.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.560
No way, man!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:54.270
I'm telling you, that Z and I are connected.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.360
Akio!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:58.120
Anyway, be careful with that cigarette, Maa.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.980
If they catch you, you won't be graduating either.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:02.890
See ya.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.910
There's a guy who really stands out.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.710
It seems that he drives around Wangan every night.

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:22.410
Everyone's scared of it, saying it's a ghost.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.670
I mean, even the number is the same!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.930
It's definitely that same Z,

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.490
the Devil Z!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.240
<i>When you're driving over 200 km/h per hour,</i>

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.130
<i>it's as if the other cars aren't moving.</i>

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.040
<i>Casual, gentle curves</i>

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.220
<i>draw near at a ridiculous speed.</i>

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.450
<i>More...</i>

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.050
<i>And more...</i>

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.300
<i>You just keep urging me on.</i>

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.170
<i>It's as if I'm invincible with this car.</i>

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.740
<i>Even if the adversary is the BlackBird...</i>

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.120
<i>It's the BlackBird!</i>

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.350
So, you came out to play, Emperor of Wangan!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.790
Ok, I'm up for this.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.210
Yokohama 33.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:17.070
Te 53-681.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:19.070
That's definitely it...

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.570
My dead friend's Z.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.630
C'mon, Z!

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:58.540
<i>Kou-chan? Something came up on that Z.</i>

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:03.330
<i>This Asakura guy was apparently quite
famous on Wangan until two years ago.</i>

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.130
Two years ago?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.050
So, did he quit?

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.300
<i>Ah, no...</i>

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:09.810
<i>He's dead.</i>

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:12.080
D–Dead?!

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:13.840
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:15.720
<i>Died at dawn on Wangan.</i>

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.120
<i>Asakura!</i>

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:35.040
There's no way I'll lose

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:37.640
as long as I have this Z!

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:50.820
I'm leading. I can do this!

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:54.590
That's right. I'm not losing this one.

00:22:54.590 --> 00:22:57.090
There's no way...
